Chapter: HttpFetch
  cites Net chapter NetDriver
  cites Net chapter Ethernet
  cites Net chapter NetworkStack
  cites Net chapter TcpTransport
  cites Net chapter NetIO
  cites Net chapter HttpClient
  cites Net chapter DnsResolver
  cites Net chapter Udp
